B.b5d=s(["Sit, stand or lie comfortably with your knees slightly apart.","Imagine you're trying to stop yourself passing wind and, at the same time, stop the flow of wee. That squeeze and lift is your pelvic floor.","Only do this as a test. Don't practise by stopping when you actually wee.","Your tummy, bottom and thighs should stay relaxed, and keep breathing normally."],t.s)
