B.bir=s(["Slow squeezes: squeeze and lift, hold for a few seconds, then let go fully and rest. Start with what feels comfortable and build up to holding for 10 seconds.","Quick squeezes: squeeze and lift quickly, then let go straight away. These help when you cough, sneeze or laugh.","Common guidance, for example from the NHS, is to aim for about 10 of each, three times a day.","Letting go fully between squeezes matters as much as the squeeze.","It usually takes a few months to notice a difference, so keep going."],t.s)
